  "solution": "The logic followed here is:-\n\n**Sum of digits of numbers = 11**\n\n(272, 353, 452)\n\n272 → 2 + 7 + 2 = 11\n\n353 → 3 + 5 + 3 = 11\n\n452 → 4 + 5 + 2 = 11\n\nSimilarly,\n\n**(560, 443, 263)**\n\n**560 → 5 + 6 + 0 = 11**\n\n**443 → 4 + 4 + 3 = 11**\n\n**263 → 2 + 6 + 3 = 11**\n\nHence, the correct answer is **\"(560, 443, 263)\".**",
